Go; Uozumi, Yasuhiro; Shinagawa, Tsutomu; Shimomura, Osamu; Nomura, Ryoki
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synlett (2016), 27(8), 1202-1206

