4-((1S,2S)-2-(3-chlorophenyl)cyclopropyl)benzoate (8b)
1-Cyclopropyl-4-methoxybenzene (8h)8 The product was prepared by the
general procedure C using 232 mg of 6h (1.0 mmol). The crude product was
purified by flash chromatography (100 % Pentane -99:1 Pentane/Et2O)
yielding the title compound (59.6 mg, 80%) as a colorless oil. Rf: 0.42
(9:1 Hexanes/EtOAc). 1H-NMR(CDCl3, 400 MHz): δ 7.03-7.00 (m, 2H),
6.83-6.79 (m, 2H), 3.78 (s, 3H), 1.90-1.81 (m, 1H), 0.92-0.87 (m, 2H),
0.63-0.59 (m, 2H).
