$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2.3. General procedure A (in the Presence of
Ligand PN-1, Table 2) The title compound c7 was also prepared from the
reaction of (p-methoxypyhenyl)triethoxysilane with iodobenzene (90 mg,
49% yield). 4-Methoxybiphenyl (c7). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 3.87 (s,
3H), 7.00 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 2H), 7.32 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 1H), 7.43 (d, J = 7.2
Hz, 2H), 7.55 (m, 4H); 13C NMR (75MHz, CDCl3) δ 55.5, 114.3, 126.8,
126.9, 128.3, 128.9, 133.9, 141.0, 159.3; HRMS (APCI) Calcd for C13H13O
(MH)+ 185.0966, found 185.0964.
